<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>One Rising Sun | Expedition Growth Lab</title><meta name="description" content="One Rising Sun is XGL's values-aligned partnership program for independent builders, brands, suppliers, creators, and community leaders."><link rel="icon" type="image/webp" href="/assets/xgl-favicon.webp"><style>
:root{--ink:#090d0e;--night:#0d171a;--cream:#f2eee7;--muted:#b6c0bd;--ember:#e85f2c;--gold:#dca552;--cyan:#73c6d6;--line:rgba(255,255,255,.16);--serif:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;--sans:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif}*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{margin:0;background:var(--ink);color:var(--cream);font-family:var(--sans)}a{color:inherit}.shell{width:min(1180px,calc(100% - 48px));margin:auto}nav{height:78px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;position:absolute;z-index:4;left:0;right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.brand{letter-spacing:.24em;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none}.brand:before{content:"— ";color:var(--ember)}.navlinks{display:flex;gap:28px;align-items:center;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.11em;text-transform:uppercase}.navlinks a{text-decoration:none;color:#e7e2da}.navlinks .xgl{opacity:.65}.navlinks .talk{border:1px solid rgba(232,95,44,.65);padding:12px 17px;border-radius:999px}.hero{min-height:920px;position:relative;isolation:isolate;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(6,9,10,.91) 0%,rgba(6,9,10,.67) 42%,rgba(6,9,10,.27) 75%,rgba(6,9,10,.52) 100%),linear-gradient(145deg,#16110e,#0b191d 60%,#071115)}.hero:before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:url("data:image/webp;base64,[... ELLIPSIZATION ...]");background-size:cover;background-position:center;z-index:-2}.hero:after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.22),transparent 60%,#090d0e),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(10,14,15,.72) 0%,rgba(10,14,15,.08) 75%);z-index:-1}.hero-grid{padding-top:190px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,760px) minmax(250px,1fr);gap:60px}.eyebrow{display:flex;gap:13px;align-items:center;color:var(--cyan);font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase}.eyebrow:before{content:"";width:38px;height:2px;background:var(--ember)}h1{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(68px,8.2vw,122px);line-height:.84;letter-spacing:-.055em;margin:30px 0 32px;max-width:880px}.sunword{color:var(--gold);font-style:italic}.hero-copy{font-size:19px;line-height:1.65;max-width:620px;color:#e3dfd7}.actions{display:flex;gap:14px;margin-top:38px}.button{display:inline-flex;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.13em;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;padding:16px 20px;border:1px solid var(--line)}.primary{background:var(--ember);border-color:var(--ember);color:white}.secondary{background:rgba(4,8,9,.35);backdrop-filter:blur(8px)}.hero-aside{align-self:end;margin-bottom:80px;border-left:1px solid rgba(220,165,82,.55);padding:8px 0 8px 25px;color:#e1ddd5}.hero-aside strong{display:block;font-family:var(--serif);font-size:25px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:14px}.hero-aside p{color:#bfc6c2;font-size:13px;line-height:1.65;margin:0}section{padding:120px 0}.intro{background:#0c1213}.intro-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.85fr 1.3fr;gap:100px}.kicker{color:var(--ember);font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.2em}.section-title{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:clamp(42px,5vw,70px);font-weight:400;line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.035em;margin:18px 0}.lede{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:31px;line-height:1.35;margin:0}.bodycopy{font-size:16px;line-height:1.85;color:var(--muted)}.bodycopy strong{color:var(--cream)}.manifesto{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#23140f,#101b1e 60%,#0b1113)}.manifesto-head{max-width:760px}.values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);margin-top:72px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.value{padding:34px 27px 36px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}.value:last-child{border-right:0}.num{color:var(--gold);font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic}.value h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;font-weight:400;margin:24px 0 13px}.value p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--muted);margin:0}.paths{background:#e9e3d9;color:#13191a}.path-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.85fr 1.25fr;gap:90px}.path-list{border-top:1px solid rgba(13,23,26,.22)}.path{display:grid;grid-template-columns:55px 1fr auto;gap:18px;align-items:center;padding:25px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(13,23,26,.22)}.path span:first-child{font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic;color:#bd4520}.path strong{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:25px;font-weight:400}.path em{font-style:normal;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.15em;color:#65706f}.fit{background:#0b1112}.fit-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px;margin-top:60px}.fit-card{padding:45px;border:1px solid var(--line);min-height:265px}.fit-card h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:30px;font-weight:400;margin:14px 0}.fit-card p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;margin:0}.fit-card small{color:var(--cyan);letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase}.cta{text-align:center;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 115%,rgba(232,95,44,.28),transparent 44%),#111719;padding:140px 0}.cta h2{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:clamp(50px,7vw,92px);line-height:.95;font-weight:400;max-width:880px;margin:20px auto 30px}.cta p{color:var(--muted);font-size:18px;max-width:620px;margin:0 auto 38px;line-height:1.7}footer{padding:35px 0;background:#080b0c;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}footer .shell{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#88928f}@media(max-width:850px){.navlinks a:not(.talk){display:none}.shell{width:min(100% - 30px,1180px)}.hero{min-height:820px}.hero-grid,.intro-grid,.path-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero-grid{padding-top:160px}.hero-aside{display:none}h1{font-size:68px}.values{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.fit-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.intro-grid,.path-grid{gap:35px}}@media(max-width:540px){.brand{font-size:10px}.navlinks{gap:8px}.navlinks .talk{padding:10px}.hero{min-height:760px}.hero-grid{padding-top:135px}h1{font-size:55px}.hero-copy{font-size:16px}.actions{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}.values{grid-template-columns:1fr}.value{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}section{padding:85px 0}.lede{font-size:25px}.fit-card{padding:30px}.path{grid-template-columns:42px 1fr}.path em{display:none}}</style></head><body>
<header class="hero"><nav class="shell"><a class="brand" href="/">Expedition Growth Lab</a><div class="navlinks"><a class="xgl" href="/">Return to XGL</a><a href="#purpose">Purpose</a><a href="#paths">Partnership Paths</a><a class="talk" href="/contact">Start a Conversation</a></div></nav><div class="shell hero-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">One Rising Sun Partnership Program</div><h1>One <span class="sunword">rising sun</span><br>lights the trail<br>for all of us.</h1><p class="hero-copy">A values-aligned partnership program for builders, brands, suppliers, creators, and community leaders working to make the overland world stronger—not merely louder.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/contact">Explore Partnership</a><a class="button secondary" href="#purpose">Why We Gather</a></div></div><aside class="hero-aside"><strong>More light on the trail means more operators make it home.</strong><p>Shared knowledge. Stronger systems. Better tools. Relationships built for the long road.</p></aside></div></header>
<main><section class="intro" id="purpose"><div class="shell intro-grid"><div><div class="kicker">A partnership with a point</div><h2 class="section-title">Built to amplify the whole trail.</h2></div><div><p class="lede">One Rising Sun is where independent strengths become shared capability.</p><div class="bodycopy"><p>It brings together companies and people whose work creates <strong>real utility, trust, reach, expertise, or opportunity</strong> for the rugged-business ecosystem.</p><p>This is reciprocal by design: education that helps builders decide, referrals that respect the relationship, systems that strengthen the work, and visibility earned by bringing something useful to the campfire.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="manifesto"><div class="shell"><div class="manifesto-head"><div class="kicker">The shared standard</div><h2 class="section-title">Different roles. One responsibility to the trail.</h2><p class="bodycopy">Partnership is not a logo arrangement. It is a promise about how value enters—and moves through—the community.</p></div><div class="values"><article class="value"><span class="num">01</span><h3>Utility before visibility</h3><p>Useful tools, honest knowledge, and real support outrank attention for its own sake.</p></article><article class="value"><span class="num">02</span><h3>Trust before transaction</h3><p>Relationships are built with care, clarity, and respect for the people already doing the work.</p></article><article class="value"><span class="num">03</span><h3>Strength without capture</h3><p>We help independent builders become more capable without sanding away what makes them worth protecting.</p></article><article class="value"><span class="num">04</span><h3>Growth that comes home</h3><p>Success should strengthen founders, employees, customers, communities, and the trail itself.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="paths" id="paths"><div class="shell path-grid"><div><div class="kicker">Ways to work together</div><h2 class="section-title">Partnership with more than one gear.</h2><p class="bodycopy" style="color:#566160">Every relationship is shaped around genuine fit. No prefab sponsorship boxes. No ceremonial logo migration.</p></div><div class="path-list"><div class="path"><span>01</span><strong>Co-marketing & field campaigns</strong><em>Shared reach</em></div><div class="path"><span>02</span><strong>Qualified introductions & referrals</strong><em>Trusted bridges</em></div><div class="path"><span>03</span><strong>Education & builder intelligence</strong><em>Shared knowledge</em></div><div class="path"><span>04</span><strong>Preferred tools & implementation</strong><em>Practical systems</em></div><div class="path"><span>05</span><strong>Sponsorship & ecosystem investment</strong><em>Long-horizon value</em></div></div></div></section>
<section class="fit"><div class="shell"><div class="kicker">Who gathers here</div><h2 class="section-title">Partners who bring value, not noise.</h2><div class="fit-grid"><article class="fit-card"><small>Industry & craft</small><h3>Builders, manufacturers, suppliers, and service operators</h3><p>Companies whose products and work increase capability, reliability, safety, access, or life in the field.</p></article><article class="fit-card"><small>Systems & technology</small><h3>Tools that make rugged businesses stronger</h3><p>CRM, operations, finance, communication, automation, and technology partners who respect the humans using them.</p></article><article class="fit-card"><small>Media & creators</small><h3>Trusted voices with something useful to say</h3><p>Educators, storytellers, photographers, publications, and creators who deepen understanding instead of feeding the content furnace.</p></article><article class="fit-card"><small>Community & stewardship</small><h3>Organizations protecting what makes this possible</h3><p>Clubs, events, nonprofits, access advocates, safety organizations, and stewards strengthening the common ground.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="cta"><div class="shell"><div class="kicker">Start the conversation</div><h2>Bring something useful<br>to the rising sun.</h2><p>If your work helps serious operators move with more clarity, control, capability, or care, there may be a place for us on the same trail.</p><a class="button primary" href="/contact">Talk with XGL</a><div style="margin-top:48px;font-size:11px;color:#85908e">Partnerships are reviewed case by case. <a href="/terms">Read program terms</a>.</div></div></section></main><footer><div class="shell"><span>Expedition Growth Lab LLC</span><span>Protect the Build. Grow the Legacy.</span></div></footer></body></html>